OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIn the Central Belt it will be
OL,6,Fa fine bright and dry day with light
OL,7,Fwinds. Cloudy across Angus and
OL,8,Fnorthern areas of Central and Tayside
OL,9,Fwith a few light showers appearing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloud and scattered light
OL,12,Fshowers in the far north at first,
OL,13,Fextending southwards across eastern
OL,14,Fareas from late evening. Elsewhere dry
OL,15,Fwith some clear spells.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FCloudy for much of the day,
OL,18,Fwith a few light showers developing.
OL,19,FSome chance of brighter spells
OL,20,Fappearing later in the day. Winds
OL,21,Flight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
