OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMainly
OL,6,Fcloudy with some patchy light rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle, always focused around the
OL,8,Fcoast and most persistent on Thursday.
OL,9,FWinds light. Early frost and possibily
OL,10,Ffog patches in west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
